'''Count Owlbrow''' (まゆげ伯爵 ''Mayu-ge Hakushaku'', '''Count Mayu-ge''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

