==Enemy==
This variant of [[Owlbrow]] is much harder than the original, it has over 16 times the health of its predecessor, has longer range than a lot of ranged attackers, and over double the attack power. Additionally, it can knockback and slow your cats. This enemy can be a pain, particularly in [[Elite Corps (Insane)|Elite Corps]], where it will interfere with your efforts to kill the mighty [[Mega Cat (Enemy)|Mega Cat]]. Another notable difference is that it has 2 knockbacks, so you can tell when this enemy has below 50% health.

==Strategy==
Decent meatshielding will be needed to stall this owl while a stack of ranged cats does work against its massive health. Anti-floating cats with good range like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]], [[Nurse Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Nurse Cat]], or [[Sodom (Uber Rare Cat)|Sodom]] can effectively control it. Even then, sometimes they'll spawn in swarms, proving to be a dangerous threat.

